WEBVTT

00:02:58.848 --> 00:03:00.203
I rarely have a theme.

00:03:00.865 --> 00:03:03.169
I find beautiful objects
from all over the world,

00:03:03.183 --> 00:03:06.021
and I curate them into 3-D tapestries

00:03:06.045 --> 00:03:08.705
over a base layer that covers
my whole body shape ...

00:03:08.729 --> 00:03:10.670
because I'm not very happy with my body.

00:03:10.694 --> 00:03:11.844
(Laughs)

00:03:12.177 --> 00:03:14.177
I ask myself, "Should I take something off

00:03:14.201 --> 00:03:16.395
or should I put something on?

00:03:16.419 --> 00:03:17.592
100 pieces, maybe?"

00:03:17.616 --> 00:03:19.062
And sometimes, I do that.

00:03:20.963 --> 00:03:23.767
I promise you it's not
too uncomfortable --

00:03:23.791 --> 00:03:25.333
well, just a little --

00:03:25.357 --> 00:03:26.437
(Laughter)

00:03:26.461 --> 00:03:28.700
I might have a safety pin
poking at me sometimes

00:03:28.724 --> 00:03:30.629
when I'm having a conversation with you,